                     /note="Domain:cl28302:CDA1 Peptidoglycan/xylan/chitin
                     deacetylase, PgdA/CDA1 family [Carbohydrate transport and
                     metabolism, Cell wall/membrane/envelope biogenesis].
                     Members of this protein family belong to the family of
                     polysaccharide deacetylases (pfam01522). All are found in
                     species that encode the PEP-CTERM/exosortase system
                     predicted to act in protein sorting in a number of
                     Gram-negative bacteria, and are found near the epsH homolog
                     that is the putative exosortase gene. The highest scoring
                     homologs below the trusted cutoff for this model are found
